{"unit_id":"tag:08FH:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 <MATH_0003> 的对象（object）。以\n<MATH_0004>\n表示对应的局部化（localization）态射（morphism）。拉回（pullback）函子（functor）<MATH_0005> 正合（exact），因为它就是限制（restriction）函子（functor）。因此，对任意复形（complex），只需限制（restricting）该复形（complex），就能计算导出拉回（derived pullback）<MATH_0006>。我们常将对应函子（functor）简记为\n<MATH_0007>\n类似地，零延拓（extension by zero）<MATH_0008>（见《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》定义 <REF_0001>）是正合（exact）函子（functor）（《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0002>）。因此，它诱导函子（functor）\n<MATH_0009>\n只需将 <MATH_0010> 应用于表示（representing）对象（object）<MATH_0011> 的任意复形（complex）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"restricting","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"derived pullback","target_term":"导出拉回"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"extension by zero","target_term":"零延拓"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"位点及导出范畴对象"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化","context":"局部化态射